    {
      "version": "0.2.5",
      "tag": "v0.2.5",
      "date": "2026-09-28",
      "notes": "Fixes a slowdown and a notes-not-showing bug affecting profiles with an existing vault (most noticeable when the vault is a real Obsidian folder).\n\nThe vault listing was walking into internal/hidden folders on every reload before filtering them out, including the profile's own live database folder and, for a real Obsidian vault, its plugin-cache folder. That's fixed now: those folders are skipped up front instead of walked and filtered after the fact.\n\nA new/empty profile wasn't affected, which is why deleting and recreating one worked around it.",
