    {
      "version": "0.2.4",
      "tag": "v0.2.4",
      "date": "2026-09-28",
      "notes": "## What's new in v0.2.4\n\n- **Fixed: importing a notes vault could leave the Notes tab looking empty.** The import itself was always working, but the vault listing could silently abort if it hit even one unreadable folder anywhere in the tree (permissions, a broken symlink, a cloud-sync file that hadn't finished downloading, etc.), so the Notes tab would show nothing even though your notes were really there on disk. It now skips a bad folder instead of blanking the whole listing, and tells you if something still goes wrong instead of failing silently.\n- **Removed the decorative orbit graphic from the sidebar.**",
