    {
      "version": "0.2.3",
      "tag": "v0.2.3",
      "date": "2026-09-26",
      "notes": "## What's new in v0.2.3\n\n- **The tutor chat is now completely free.** No subscription, no sign-in, no \"1st month free.\" Bring your own API key or a local model and go. It was never really Engram's to charge for, since you're already paying for that AI access yourself.\n- **Cloud backup is Engram's one paid feature.** $5/month, first month free, cancel any time. Manual, one slot: \"Back up now\" snapshots your profile, \"Restore from backup\" brings it back on another machine.\n- **New: manage your subscription from the website.** Sign in with an email code at engram.itarin.online/subscription to check your Cloud backup status, subscribe, or open Stripe's billing portal without opening the app.",
