    {
      "version": "0.2.1",
      "tag": "v0.2.1",
      "date": "2026-09-26",
      "notes": "- **In-app update checks.** Engram can now check for new versions on its own and notify you right in the app — no more finding out about updates by chance. Checking happens automatically in the background and never installs anything without you clicking \"Update now.\"\n- **Snooze for 90 days.** If you'd rather not be bothered, dismissing an update prompt with the checkbox checked keeps Engram quiet about updates for 90 days. Updating is always optional.\n- Manual \"Check for updates\" button added to Settings → About.\n- Release artifacts are now cryptographically signed, which is what makes the above possible.",
