    {
      "version": "0.1.0",
      "tag": "v0.1.0",
      "date": "2026-09-26",
      "notes": "First public release.\n\n- Notes, flashcards with spaced repetition, quizzes, a code sandbox and study timers, all local-first: everything lives in plain files on your computer.\n- Import from Obsidian, Notion, Roam, Logseq, Bear, Apple Notes, Anki (.apkg) or a spreadsheet/CSV export.\n- Optional paid tutor add-on (bring your own OpenAI-compatible API key, or run a free local model) and optional cloud backup, both $5/month after a free first month. Everything else is free forever.\n- Windows only for this first release; macOS and Linux builds are planned.",
